      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Also documented: there is no docker0 on the host; Docker Desktop cannot route traffic to Linux containers (you cannot ping them), and per-container IPs are not reachable\nfrom the host.\nSources: Docker docs: desktop/features/networking, networking-how-tos, faqs/platform, windows-permission-requirements (read 2026-11-13).",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "b18",
      "originalText": "Also documented: there is no docker0 on the host; Docker Desktop cannot route traffic to Linux containers (you cannot ping them), and per-container IPs are not reachable from the host.\nSources: Docker docs: desktop/features/networking, networking-how-tos, faqs/platform, windows-permission-requirements (read 2026-11-13).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
